      "content": "that makes sense. the \"sterile area\" thing sounds like the biggest risk for the Indian passport group then. if they have to re-check bags, they're basically entering. \n\ncan you expand a bit on the \"red flags\" for the immigration officers? like, beyond just the visa, are there other things at the actual border checkpoints that tend to trip people up or cause delays? just want to prepare them for any weird or sudden hurdles they might face when they're standing in line.",
